      "id": "34674530",
      "title": "Adding Dynamic Routes & Dot-delimited Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 29,
      "videoOrder": 25,
      "sourceHash": "ce068c9e42aec84f85c585a0f808b389c2b08b0b68260604e0cc5141fb9cfd0b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 4.17,
          "en": "So, now we can add notes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.17,
          "end": 5.49,
          "en": "we can handle errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.49,
          "end": 7.95,
          "en": "and this overall application is taking shape.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.95,
          "end": 11.823,
          "en": "And we also already learned quite a bit about Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.87,
          "end": 15.81,
          "en": "One crucial feature is missing, which definitely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.81,
          "end": 19.83,
          "en": "also must be covered in this essentials section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.83,
          "end": 22.14,
          "en": "and that would be dynamic routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.14,
          "end": 24.333,
          "en": "Now, what are dynamic routes still?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.5,
          "end": 27.66,
          "en": "At the moment we have two routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.66,
          "end": 30.72,
          "en": "And now let's say we wanna make these notes clickable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.72,
          "end": 32.85,
          "en": "and we wanna show these note details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 36.45,
          "en": "in some full screen mode if we do click them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.45,
          "end": 38.85,
          "en": "So then we need a new route that shows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.85,
          "end": 40.68,
          "en": "these note details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.68,
          "end": 41.69,
          "en": "And of course it would be one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.69,
          "end": 45.03,
          "en": "in the same route and one at the same component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.03,
          "end": 47.52,
          "en": "one at the same page for all the notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.52,
          "end": 49.38,
          "en": "But the content would be different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.38,
          "end": 52.74,
          "en": "because if we have multiple notes, like Remix is awesome",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.74,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "as a second note, it really is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 58.44,
          "en": "Then of course if I click this note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 59.55,
          "en": "I wanna see the details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.55,
          "end": 62.16,
          "en": "of this note on the full screen page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.16,
          "end": 65.01,
          "en": "And if I click the first note, I wanna see those details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.01,
          "end": 67.68,
          "en": "So one Route but with different content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.68,
          "end": 70.32300000000001,
          "en": "And that's exactly what a dynamic route is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.55,
          "end": 74.64,
          "en": "Now we add such a dynamic route by adding a new file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.64,
          "end": 77.7,
          "en": "to the routes folder and giving it a special file name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.7,
          "end": 80.523,
          "en": "a file name that starts with a dollar sign.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.75,
          "end": 86.37,
          "en": "And here that could be noteid.jsx, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 89.46000000000001,
          "en": "though the part after the dollar sign is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.46000000000001,
          "end": 93.39,
          "en": "It could also be just ID, or a note, or whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.39,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "But here I'll go for note ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.64,
          "end": 98.25,
          "en": "The dollar sign in front of note ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.25,
          "end": 100.95,
          "en": "signals to Remix that this is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.95,
          "end": 103.35,
          "en": "a dynamic route and a dynamic route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.35,
          "end": 106.32,
          "en": "simply means that the actual value in the path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.32,
          "end": 108.66,
          "en": "will not be dollar sign note ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.66,
          "end": 111.36,
          "en": "but instead that only acts as a placeholder for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.36,
          "end": 115.95,
          "en": "the actual value that will later be encoded in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.95,
          "end": 119.13,
          "en": "And you probably already know this concept of dynamic routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.13,
          "end": 122.46,
          "en": "from react router express JS, or a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.46,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "of other routing libraries as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 129.03,
          "en": "Now here in this dollar sign noteid.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.03,
          "end": 132.12,
          "en": "we again should export a default function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.12,
          "end": 134.7,
          "en": "maybe called note details page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.7,
          "end": 137.4,
          "en": "name of course is up to you as you know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.4,
          "end": 140.52,
          "en": "And there I wanna return some markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.52,
          "end": 142.68,
          "en": "I wanna return a main element with an ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.68,
          "end": 147.68,
          "en": "of note dash details, which then includes a header maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.34,
          "end": 151.92000000000002,
          "en": "And in there a nav element where I simply have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.92000000000002,
          "end": 156.54,
          "en": "a link imported from Remix run react,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.54,
          "end": 158.61,
          "en": "which points back to slash notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.61,
          "end": 161.46,
          "en": "So to that overview page where we add notes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.46,
          "end": 163.053,
          "en": "and see that list of notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.04,
          "end": 167.883,
          "en": "And we could give this link a label off back to all notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 171.81,
          "en": "And then below this nav element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.81,
          "end": 174.57,
          "en": "I have a H1 element where I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.57,
          "end": 176.55,
          "en": "to output the note title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.55,
          "end": 178.5,
          "en": "So this should actually be dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.5,
          "end": 180.003,
          "en": "It will be replaced soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.9,
          "end": 183.96,
          "en": "And below the header, I wanna have a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 183.96,
          "end": 188.53,
          "en": "with an ID of note dash details, dash content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189.6,
          "end": 191.85,
          "en": "and then here to note content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.85,
          "end": 195.18,
          "en": "Now these IDs are important for styling purposes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.18,
          "end": 196.62,
          "en": "because attached to you all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.62,
          "end": 199.23,
          "en": "find a note detail.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.23,
          "end": 201.993,
          "en": "which you should move into your styles folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.46,
          "end": 206.28,
          "en": "And then in the note ID JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.28,
          "end": 209.34,
          "en": "the dollar sign noteid.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.34,
          "end": 213.15,
          "en": "You should import that CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 213.15,
          "end": 214.78,
          "en": "like this for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.11,
          "end": 221.16,
          "en": "and then export this special links function you already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 221.16,
          "end": 226.16,
          "en": "learned about earlier where we have one style sheet link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.37,
          "end": 229.95,
          "en": "which simply loads those imported styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.95,
          "end": 232.983,
          "en": "so that we do load these page specific styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.69,
          "end": 236.49,
          "en": "Now this is my note details page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.49,
          "end": 238.233,
          "en": "but of course the data is missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.49,
          "end": 241.47,
          "en": "Now before we add the missing data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 241.47,
          "end": 243.66,
          "en": "let's make sure that we can reach this page and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.66,
          "end": 246.24,
          "en": "we can reach it already since it is a registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.24,
          "end": 249.6,
          "en": "route by going to our website and for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.6,
          "end": 252.18,
          "en": "entering note dash one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.18,
          "end": 254.583,
          "en": "So not notes, but note dash one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.66,
          "end": 257.85,
          "en": "Instead of getting a 404 error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 257.85,
          "end": 260.254,
          "en": "we now see this notes detail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.254,
          "end": 263.19,
          "en": "because that's what dynamic Routes are all about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.19,
          "end": 268.17,
          "en": "This value, note dash one, is now interpreted by Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 268.17,
          "end": 271.06,
          "en": "as a value for this note ID placeholder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.15999999999997,
          "end": 274.5,
          "en": "and it's this dollar sign that tells Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 274.5,
          "end": 276.063,
          "en": "that this is a placeholder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 277.32,
          "end": 280.95,
          "en": "So whatever we enter here, including ABC, is now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 280.95,
          "end": 284.25,
          "en": "treated as a value for this note ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 284.25,
          "end": 287.85,
          "en": "We can still enter slash notes, Remix is smart enough",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 287.85,
          "end": 291.45,
          "en": "to understand that there is a dedicated route for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.45,
          "end": 294.69,
          "en": "the path notes, but basically anything else is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 294.69,
          "end": 297.81,
          "en": "treated as a value for this note ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 297.81,
          "end": 300.573,
          "en": "So that's how we can register such a dynamic route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 301.53,
          "end": 303.78,
          "en": "To also go there dynamically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 303.78,
          "end": 307.47,
          "en": "we can go to the note list JSX element and wrap",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 307.47,
          "end": 312.03,
          "en": "this article with the link component, which is imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 312.03,
          "end": 314.103,
          "en": "from Remix Run React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.12,
          "end": 319.923,
          "en": "Move the closing tag here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 320.76,
          "end": 325.11,
          "en": "And then the two prop of this link points to the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.11,
          "end": 328.293,
          "en": "note ID for which we wanna load this detailed page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 329.25,
          "end": 330.81,
          "en": "Here this means that I'll set this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 330.81,
          "end": 333.87,
          "en": "to a dynamic value and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 333.87,
          "end": 336.093,
          "en": "I'll use note ID as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 337.77,
          "end": 339.45,
          "en": "Out of the box, the link component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 339.45,
          "end": 341.4,
          "en": "supports relative paths here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 341.4,
          "end": 344.28,
          "en": "for the two prop, which means if I enter something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 344.28,
          "end": 348.12,
          "en": "like note one here, this is automatically appended",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 348.12,
          "end": 350.79,
          "en": "after the currently active path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 350.79,
          "end": 352.47,
          "en": "If I add a slash at the beginning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 352.47,
          "end": 354.69,
          "en": "it would instead be an absolute path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 354.69,
          "end": 356.55,
          "en": "which in this case would be the same, but it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 356.55,
          "end": 359.49,
          "en": "can be useful for easily constructing longer paths",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 359.49,
          "end": 362.16,
          "en": "by just adding some new fragment here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 362.16,
          "end": 365.58,
          "en": "and letting the link and Remix automatically appended",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 365.58,
          "end": 367.8,
          "en": "to the currently active path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 367.8,
          "end": 369.78,
          "en": "And here that's what we'll do with Note ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 369.78,
          "end": 372.663,
          "en": "It's simply appended to the currently active path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 374.19,
          "end": 377.41,
          "en": "Which means that if I save this, if I click this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 378.48,
          "end": 380.76,
          "en": "it tries to go to slash notes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 380.76,
          "end": 383.49,
          "en": "and then this ID, because as I mentioned it adds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 383.49,
          "end": 385.2,
          "en": "it to the currently active path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 385.2,
          "end": 387.33,
          "en": "And since I am on slash notes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 387.33,
          "end": 389.433,
          "en": "it adds the ID after this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 390.45,
          "end": 392.19,
          "en": "Now since this doesn't lead us to the note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 392.19,
          "end": 393.84000000000003,
          "en": "we have two options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 393.84000000000003,
          "end": 396.63,
          "en": "We rename this file to make sure that it does",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 396.63,
          "end": 399.42,
          "en": "start with slash notes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 399.42,
          "end": 402.09000000000003,
          "en": "or we change our link here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 402.09000000000003,
          "end": 404.73,
          "en": "and convert it to an absolute path.",
